{"id":420356989,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOQnzqBM4ZDiN9","tag_name":"v1.6.5","target_commitish":"main","name":"v1.6.5","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-10-22T05:12:15Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:00:44Z","published_at":"2026-10-22T06:00:06Z","assets":[],"body":"## Security\n\n- SQL Server connections now verify the server's TLS certificate. Local servers work as before, and for a self-signed remote server sqlit asks once whether to trust it. #346\n- Updated locked dependencies with known vulnerabilities in `uv.lock`. This affects development and CI only. #345\n\n## Features\n\n- Leader-menu commands can be bound directly to keys in `action_keys`. Thanks @fclef819 for the request. #326, #321\n- New Vesper dark theme. Thanks @mihaicrisann. #327\n\n## Bug fixes\n\n- Text in BLOB columns shows as text again instead of hex, and cell previews with text like `[/api/v1]` no longer crash. Thanks @sykesab. #329, #328\n","mentions_count":3}
